        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({model:'qwen3.5:2b',stream:false,format:'json',options:{temperature:0},messages:[{role:'system',content:'You are a strict task classifier. Return only JSON with task_type (coding, research, or data), language (python, node, go, php, or other), target_worker (coder, researcher, or general), files (array), and success_criteria (string). Route coding tasks in any language, including Go and PHP, to coder. Do not solve the task.'},{role:'user',content:$json.task}]}) }}",
